Package: PhysioClinStats
Type: Package
Title: Clinical Inference Engine for Physiological Signal Studies
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("Yusuke", "Matsui", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "mail.to.matsui@gmail.com")
Description: Statistical inference for rehabilitation studies: mixed-effects /
    MMRM longitudinal models, single-case (N-of-1) designs, estimands with
    multiple imputation, and per-estimate uncertainty. Heavy modelling backends
    are optional (guarded) Suggests.
Depends: R (>= 4.2)
Imports:
    digest,
    PhysioCore,
    methods,
    splines,
    stats
